---
import '../../styles/catalog-admin.css';
const { catalog, mode = 'api' } = Astro.props;
const seed = JSON.stringify(catalog).replace(/</g, '\\u003c').replace(/\u2028/g, '\\u2028').replace(/\u2029/g, '\\u2029');
---
<div id="catalog-app" data-mode={mode}>
  <aside class="catalog-sidebar">
    <a class="catalog-brand" href="#catalog-main" aria-label="Hitelecom 产品目录"><span class="brand-symbol" aria-hidden="true">H</span><span>HITELECOM<small>产品工作台</small></span></a>
    <div class="sidebar-label">内容管理</div>
    <a class="sidebar-link active" href="#catalog-main"><span aria-hidden="true">▦</span> 产品目录 <span data-count="all" class="nav-count">—</span></a>
    <a class="sidebar-link" href="#category-panel"><span aria-hidden="true">≡</span> 产品分类</a>
    <div class="sidebar-note"><span class="note-dot"></span><strong>静态站点，轻松维护</strong><p>调整目录、保存数据，再通过构建更新网站。</p><span class="sidebar-version">CATALOG MANAGER · 01</span></div>
  </aside>
  <div class="catalog-shell">
    <header class="catalog-topbar"><span>产品管理 <span class="breadcrumb-divider">/</span> <strong>产品目录</strong></span><span class="mode-badge" data-mode-label>正在加载</span></header>
    <main id="catalog-main" class="catalog-main">
      <div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PRODUCT CATALOG</p><h1>产品目录</h1><p class="page-intro">把每一款传感器，放在合适的位置。</p></div><div class="heading-actions"><button type="button" class="button button-quiet" data-action="export">导出 JSON</button><button type="button" class="button button-quiet" data-action="import">导入备份</button><button type="button" class="button button-primary" data-action="add"><span aria-hidden="true">＋</span> 新增产品</button><input type="file" accept="application/json,.json" data-import-file hidden /></div></div>
      <div class="notice mode-notice" data-mode-notice role="note"></div>
      <div class="catalog-alert" data-alert role="alert" hidden></div>
      <div class="catalog-metrics" aria-label="目录概况"><div><span>全部产品</span><strong data-count="all">—</strong><small>统一管理产品资料</small></div><div><span>已发布</span><strong data-count="published">—</strong><small>纳入公开目录</small></div><div><span>草稿</span><strong data-count="draft">—</strong><small>编辑完成后可发布</small></div><div><span>产品分类</span><strong data-count="categories">—</strong><small>支持自定义排序</small></div></div>
      <section class="campaign-card" aria-labelledby="campaign-title"><div class="campaign-heading"><span class="campaign-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><div><p class="eyebrow">CAMPAIGN</p><h2 id="campaign-title">本月主推</h2><p>临时置顶一款产品，基础顺序保持不变。</p></div></div><div class="campaign-content"><div class="campaign-name" data-campaign-name>尚未设置主推产品</div><span class="campaign-state" data-campaign-state>从下方产品中选择</span><div class="campaign-dates"><label>开始日期<input type="date" data-campaign-start aria-label="主推开始日期" /></label><span class="date-divider">—</span><label>结束日期<input type="date" data-campaign-end aria-label="主推结束日期" /></label><button type="button" class="text-button" data-action="clear-campaign">清除主推</button></div></div></section>
      <div class="catalog-columns"><section class="product-panel panel" aria-labelledby="products-title"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2 id="products-title">全部产品 <span class="inline-count" data-count="all">—</span></h2><p>拖动左侧手柄，或用上下按钮调整基础顺序。</p></div><span class="base-order-label">基础排序</span></div><div class="filter-bar"><label class="search-field"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><span class="sr-only">搜索产品</span><input type="search" data-filter="search" placeholder="搜索名称、ID 或 slug" /></label><label><span class="sr-only">分类筛选</span><select data-filter="category"><option value="">全部分类</option></select></label><label><span class="sr-only">状态筛选</span><select data-filter="status"><option value="">全部状态</option><option value="published">已发布</option><option value="draft">草稿</option></select></label></div><p class="filter-notice" data-filter-notice hidden>筛选中仅查看产品。清除筛选后可调整基础顺序。</p><div class="list-heading" aria-hidden="true"><span>顺序 / 产品</span><span>管理</span></div><ol class="product-list" data-product-list aria-label="产品基础顺序"></ol><p class="empty-state" data-empty hidden>没有找到产品。试试其他关键词或分类。</p><div class="list-footer"><span data-list-summary></span><span>基础顺序不会随主推活动改变</span></div></section>
      <aside class="catalog-right-column"><section class="preview-panel panel" aria-labelledby="preview-title"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PREVIEW</p><h2 id="preview-title">日期预览</h2></div><span class="preview-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><p>按上海日期查看目录的展示顺序。</p><label class="preview-date">预览日期<input type="date" data-preview-date /></label><ol class="preview-list" data-preview-list></ol><p class="preview-footnote">仅展示已发布产品。实际页面还会按语言的发布状态筛选；活动到期需重新构建才会更新。</p></section>
      <section id="category-panel" class="category-panel panel" aria-labelledby="category-title"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CATEGORIES</p><h2 id="category-title">产品分类</h2></div><span class="inline-count" data-count="categories">—</span></div><ol class="category-list" data-category-list></ol><details class="add-category"><summary>＋ 新增分类</summary><form data-category-form><label>分类 ID<input name="categoryId" required pattern="[a-z0-9]+(?:-[a-z0-9]+)*" maxlength="100" placeholder="例如 environment" /></label><label>英文名称<input name="categoryEn" required maxlength="160" placeholder="Environment" /></label><label>中文名称<input name="categoryZh" maxlength="160" placeholder="环境监测" /></label><button class="button button-secondary" type="submit">添加分类</button></form></details></section></aside></div>
      <footer class="workspace-footnote">HITELECOM <span>产品资料 · 分类 · 多语言内容</span></footer>
    </main>
    <div class="save-bar"><div><span class="save-indicator" data-save-indicator></span><div><strong data-save-title>目录已加载</strong><p data-save-description>编辑后保存目录数据。</p></div></div><div class="save-actions"><button type="button" class="button button-quiet" data-action="discard" disabled>放弃更改</button><button type="button" class="button button-primary" data-action="save" disabled>保存更改 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div></div>
  </div>
  <dialog class="product-dialog" data-product-dialog aria-labelledby="editor-title"><form data-product-form><div class="dialog-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">PRODUCT EDITOR</p><h2 id="editor-title">新增产品</h2><p>填写英文名称与分类即可创建草稿，其余资料可稍后完善。</p></div><button type="button" class="icon-button" data-action="close-editor" aria-label="关闭编辑">×</button></div><div class="dialog-body"><div class="editor-section-heading"><h3>基本资料</h3><span>已发布产品的标识和已有发布地址不可修改</span></div><div class="form-grid"><label>分类<select name="categoryId" required></select></label><label>状态<select name="status"><option value="draft">草稿</option><option value="published">已发布</option></select></label><label class="form-full">图片地址<input name="imageSrc" maxlength="2048" placeholder="/images/product.jpg 或 https://…" /></label><label class="form-full">图片默认说明<input name="imageAlt" maxlength="500" placeholder="描述产品外观，不使用文件名" /></label></div><details class="advanced-fields"><summary>高级设置 · 标识与页面生成</summary><p>新增产品会根据英文名称自动生成 ID、Slug 和英文地址，可在发布前调整。</p><div class="form-grid"><label>产品 ID <span class="field-required">*</span><input name="id" required maxlength="100" pattern="[a-z0-9]+(?:-[a-z0-9]+)*" placeholder="例如 tilt-sensor" /></label><label>Slug <span class="field-required">*</span><input name="slug" required maxlength="100" pattern="[a-z0-9]+(?:-[a-z0-9]+)*" placeholder="例如 tilt-sensor" /></label></div><label class="checkbox-label managed-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="managedPage" /><span><strong>由本模块生成产品详情页</strong><small>已有官网详情页建议保持关闭。生成页面时，需要完整的已发布语言内容。</small></span></label></details><div class="editor-section-heading locale-heading"><h3>多语言内容</h3><span>每种语言使用自己的产品地址</span></div><div class="locale-tabs" data-locale-tabs role="tablist" aria-label="编辑语言"></div><div class="locale-panel" data-locale-panel role="tabpanel"><div class="locale-status-row"><strong data-locale-title>English</strong><label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" name="localePublished" /> 发布此语言</label></div><div class="form-grid"><label class="form-full">产品名称<input name="localeName" maxlength="200" placeholder="填写英文名称即可创建草稿" /></label><label class="form-full">产品地址<input name="localeUrl" maxlength="2048" placeholder="真实的根相对地址，例如 /product/tilt-sensor" /><small data-url-hint>不会自动猜测其他语言的地址。</small></label><label class="form-full">产品摘要<textarea name="localeSummary" rows="3" maxlength="5000" placeholder="简要描述产品用途与特点"></textarea></label><label class="form-full">产品正文<textarea name="localeBody" rows="7" maxlength="100000" placeholder="使用纯文本段落，无需填写 HTML"></textarea></label><label class="form-full">当前语言图片说明<input name="localeImageAlt" maxlength="500" placeholder="已发布的模块详情页需要填写" /></label></div><details class="advanced-fields locale-seo"><summary>SEO 设置（可选）</summary><div class="form-grid"><label>SEO 标题<input name="localeSeoTitle" maxlength="300" placeholder="可留空，使用产品名称" /></label><label>SEO 描述<textarea name="localeSeoDescription" rows="2" maxlength="1000" placeholder="可留空，使用产品摘要"></textarea></label></div></details></div><p class="form-help">生成的已发布详情页需填写名称、至少 40 字符摘要、至少 200 字符正文、图片与当前语言图片说明。草稿可稍后完善。</p><div class="catalog-alert" data-editor-alert role="alert" hidden></div></div><div class="dialog-footer"><span>保存到工作区后，再点击「保存更改」。</span><div><button type="button" class="button button-quiet" data-action="close-editor">取消</button><button type="submit" class="button button-primary">完成编辑</button></div></div></form></dialog>
  <script id="catalog-seed" type="application/json" set:html={seed}></script>
</div>
<script>
  import { initializeEditor } from '../../admin/editor.mjs';
  initializeEditor();
</script>
